  question: "Kap\u0131n\u0131 \xE7almadan gelir, gitmesi hi\xE7 kolay olmaz,\r\ng\xFClerken yan\u0131ndad\u0131r, a\u011Flarken daha yak\u0131nd\u0131r.\r\nK\xF6t\xFC g\xFCnde belli olur, a\xE7 g\xFCnde de belli olur:\r\nson ka\u015F\u0131k bal\u0131 sana b\u0131rakan odur! "
